{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0330-s001", "text": "Föräldrarna ansvarar för omsorgen om och uppfostran av barnet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071143464883Z/hb-c09-u0330-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.33514404296875, "generation_seconds": 23.51979636005126, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0330-s002", "text": "De har dock rätt att få hjälp av samhället om de behöver.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071143464883Z/hb-c09-u0330-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.268524169921875, "generation_seconds": 21.676834490848705, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0330-s003", "text": "I Finland bedriver myndigheterna mycket förebyggande arbete med barn och familjer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071143464883Z/hb-c09-u0330-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.31640625, "generation_seconds": 24.34827994904481, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0330-s004", "text": "Det betyder att samhället försöker stödja barn, föräldrar och familjer redan innan problemen blir stora.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071143464883Z/hb-c09-u0330-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.777142857142858, "peak": 0.2911376953125, "generation_seconds": 36.918716800864786, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0330-s005", "text": "Ibland behöver familjer mer stöd i svåra livssituationer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071143464883Z/hb-c09-u0330-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.433469387755102, "peak": 0.256927490234375, "generation_seconds": 24.131006798008457, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0331-s001", "text": "Familjer kan ta del av många olika slags tjänster som kan underlätta vardagen och förhindra problem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071143464883Z/hb-c09-u0331-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.916462585034013, "peak": 0.299224853515625, "generation_seconds": 34.65173346083611, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0331-s002", "text": "Man kan få hjälp och stöd hos till exempel rådgivningsbyråerna, skolan, olika organisationer och föreningar eller församlingen och andra religiösa samfund.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071143464883Z/hb-c09-u0331-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.444353741496599, "peak": 0.443145751953125, "generation_seconds": 55.87481117807329, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0332-s001", "text": "Om stödet som ges via de tjänster som är gemensamma för alla inte är tillräckligt, kan man få hjälp via socialtjänsterna för barnfamiljer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071143464883Z/hb-c09-u0332-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.051156462585034, "peak": 0.442657470703125, "generation_seconds": 48.72926458809525, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0332-s002", "text": "Dessa tjänster omfattar bland annat handledning och rådgivning, ekonomiskt stöd, hemservice och en stödperson eller en stödfamilj.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071701016724Z/hb-c09-u0332-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.075918367346938, "peak": 0.364654541015625, "generation_seconds": 38.21353698289022, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0332-s003", "text": "Barnets skolgång och hobbyer kan också stödjas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071701016724Z/hb-c09-u0332-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.268280029296875, "generation_seconds": 17.156272931955755, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0332-s004", "text": "Genom att vara klient hos barnskyddet får man dessutom mer stöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071701016724Z/hb-c09-u0332-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.2684326171875, "generation_seconds": 22.071756483986974, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0333-s001", "text": "Hemservice innebär att familjen får hembesök av en yrkesperson som hjälper till med hushållssysslor, till exempel städning, inköp eller barnomsorg.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071701016724Z/hb-c09-u0333-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.538775510204081, "peak": 0.32867431640625, "generation_seconds": 56.27091016294435, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0333-s002", "text": "Man kan få hemservice om familjen behöver särskilt stöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071701016724Z/hb-c09-u0333-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.281646728515625, "generation_seconds": 20.13654315797612, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0333-s003", "text": "Det kan vara aktuellt till exempel om den ena föräldern blir allvarligt sjuk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071701016724Z/hb-c09-u0333-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.826666666666667, "peak": 0.393798828125, "generation_seconds": 25.763145693112165, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0334-s001", "text": "En stödperson hjälper barnet med till exempel hobbyer och läxor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071701016724Z/hb-c09-u0334-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.259735107421875, "generation_seconds": 23.869338129181415, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0334-s002", "text": "En stödfamilj är en vanlig familj som barnet ibland kan bo hos, till exempel en helg per månad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T071701016724Z/hb-c09-u0334-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.2625732421875, "generation_seconds": 29.475339534925297, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0335-s001", "text": "Utgångspunkten är att man försöker hjälpa barnet på ett sådant sätt att hen kan bo hemma med sin familj.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072132494186Z/hb-c09-u0335-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.303009033203125, "generation_seconds": 31.290033656172454, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0335-s002", "text": "Om barnets eller familjens situation kräver utomstående hjälp, försöker man alltid tillämpa lindrigast möjliga metod.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072132494186Z/hb-c09-u0335-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.286651611328125, "generation_seconds": 36.68772187898867, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0335-s003", "text": "Inom barnskyddet kallas dessa tjänster för stödåtgärder inom öppenvården.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072132494186Z/hb-c09-u0335-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.371002197265625, "generation_seconds": 22.49437059601769, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0335-s004", "text": "Stödåtgärderna är alltid frivilliga och bygger på samarbete med familjen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072132494186Z/hb-c09-u0335-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.40411376953125, "generation_seconds": 29.944097100989893, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0335-s005", "text": "Nuförtiden kan man ta del av många av stödåtgärderna utan att vara klient hos barnskyddet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072132494186Z/hb-c09-u0335-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.3074951171875, "generation_seconds": 32.13586429995485, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0336-s001", "text": "Om familjen har fått en baby, om en vuxen person i familjen är utmattad eller om familjen befinner sig i någon annan särskild situation kan man ansöka om hemservice.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072132494186Z/hb-c09-u0336-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.489251700680272, "peak": 0.338348388671875, "generation_seconds": 40.73382827080786, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0336-s002", "text": "Hemservicen för barnfamiljer är praktisk hjälp i hushållsarbeten eller barnpassning som är avsedd att underlätta familjens vardag och barnfostran.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072132494186Z/hb-c09-u0336-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.747755102040816, "peak": 0.32183837890625, "generation_seconds": 40.51528498111293, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0336-s003", "text": "Barnfamiljer kan ansöka om hemservice tillfälligt eller regelbundet om familjens situation kräver detta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072132494186Z/hb-c09-u0336-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.264761904761905, "peak": 0.29388427734375, "generation_seconds": 34.66310152900405, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0336-s004", "text": "Hemservicen är vanligtvis avgiftsbelagd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072645598232Z/hb-c09-u0336-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.396484375, "generation_seconds": 17.995075159007683, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0336-s005", "text": "Familjens inkomster påverkar avgiften och dess storlek.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072645598232Z/hb-c09-u0336-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.321868896484375, "generation_seconds": 23.749193089082837, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0337-s001", "text": "Om du har problem med att betala räkningar, kan du få hjälp med och rådgivning om ekonomin.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072645598232Z/hb-c09-u0337-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.252044677734375, "generation_seconds": 31.704385163029656, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0337-s002", "text": "Om din inkomst minskar ska du ta reda på din rätt att få till exempel bostadsbidrag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072645598232Z/hb-c09-u0337-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.333251953125, "generation_seconds": 28.570519710192457, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0337-s003", "text": "Om dina inkomster och tillgångar inte räcker till den nödvändiga dagliga försörjningen, till exempel mat och läkemedel, kan du ha rätt till grundläggande utkomststöd.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072645598232Z/hb-c09-u0337-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.001632653061224, "peak": 0.3441162109375, "generation_seconds": 52.9880165560171, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0338-s001", "text": "Om ett barn eller en ung har problem i skolan eller med studierna är det bra att diskutera situationen med skolans eller läroanstaltens studievägledare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072645598232Z/hb-c09-u0338-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.02639455782313, "peak": 0.299774169921875, "generation_seconds": 44.282795367063954, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0338-s002", "text": "I skolan arbetar även en psykolog eller en kurator.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072645598232Z/hb-c09-u0338-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.31396484375, "generation_seconds": 21.92808401794173, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0338-s003", "text": "Hen hjälper elever som har svårigheter i skolan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T072645598232Z/hb-c09-u0338-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.246795654296875, "generation_seconds": 18.978635726030916, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0339-s001", "text": "Om ett barn eller en ung blir mobbad i skolan är det skolans skyldighet att ingripa i detta.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073129407648Z/hb-c09-u0339-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.314727783203125, "generation_seconds": 32.55128741497174, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0339-s002", "text": "Berätta om mobbning för läraren eller rektorn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073129407648Z/hb-c09-u0339-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.249251700680272, "peak": 0.248016357421875, "generation_seconds": 17.38044225005433, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0339-s003", "text": "Ibland kan mobbning även vara ett brott enligt lagen, som kan anmälas till polisen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073129407648Z/hb-c09-u0339-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.342987060546875, "generation_seconds": 25.79166111513041, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0339-s004", "text": "Till exempel fysiskt våld eller stjälande är brott.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073129407648Z/hb-c09-u0339-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.257843017578125, "generation_seconds": 21.65409287181683, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0340-s001", "text": "Om en ung har problem med alkohol, droger eller spelande, kan hen få hjälp vid ungdomsstationen (nuorisoasema).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073129407648Z/hb-c09-u0340-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.613061224489796, "peak": 0.327239990234375, "generation_seconds": 37.61079366109334, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0340-s002", "text": "Ungdomsstationer finns i många städer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073129407648Z/hb-c09-u0340-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.622312925170068, "peak": 0.27056884765625, "generation_seconds": 14.88799329008907, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0340-s003", "text": "Den unga kan komma till ungdomsstationen ensam eller med sina föräldrar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073129407648Z/hb-c09-u0340-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.339047619047619, "peak": 0.2791748046875, "generation_seconds": 23.895592766115442, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0341-s001", "text": "Brott har påföljder för personer under 15 år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073129407648Z/hb-c09-u0341-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.286163330078125, "generation_seconds": 18.499865164980292, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0341-s002", "text": "Personen är skyldig att ersätta de skador som hen orsakat.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073520660825Z/hb-c09-u0341-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.27685546875, "generation_seconds": 17.51537759718485, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0341-s003", "text": "Polisen anmäler brott som begåtts av barn under 18 år till föräldrarna och barnskyddsmyndigheten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-familjetjanster/narration-resume-20261103T073520660825Z/hb-c09-u0341-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.195102040816327, "peak": 0.24188232421875, "generation_seconds": 28.056388889905065, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
